  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n name:       fslpy\n version:    3.29.0\n sha256:     0d99d555a234a58ae5b2942293b3e5f18887378d1d6614458313ee8fb4b5b267\n python_min: \"3.11\"\n\npackage:\n  name: ${{ name|lower }}\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://pypi.org/packages/source/${{ name[0] }}/${{ name }}/${{ name }}-${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: ${{ sha256 }}\n\nbuild:\n  noarch: python\n  number: 0\n  script: ${{ PYTHON }} -m pip install . --no-deps --ignore-installed --no-cache-dir -vvv\n  python:\n    entry_points:\n      - Text2Vest      = fsl.scripts.Text2Vest:main\n      - Vest2Text      = fsl.scripts.Vest2Text:main\n      - atlasq         = fsl.scripts.atlasq:main\n      - atlasquery     = fsl.scripts.atlasq:atlasquery_emulation\n      - fsl_abspath    = fsl.scripts.fsl_abspath:main\n      - fsl_apply_x5   = fsl.scripts.fsl_apply_x5:main\n      - fsl_convert_x5 = fsl.scripts.fsl_convert_x5:main\n      - fsl_ents       = fsl.scripts.fsl_ents:main\n      - fslchfiletype  = fsl.scripts.fslchfiletype:main\n      - fslchpixdim    = fsl.scripts.fslchpidxim:main\n      - imcp           = fsl.scripts.imcp:main\n      - imglob         = fsl.scripts.imglob:main\n      - imln           = fsl.scripts.imln:main\n      - immv           = fsl.scripts.immv:main\n      - imrm           = fsl.scripts.imrm:main\n      - imtest         = fsl.scripts.imtest:main\n      - remove_ext     = fsl.scripts.remove_ext:main\n      - resample_image = fsl.scripts.resample_image:main\n      - tmpnam         = fsl.scripts.tmpnam:main\n\nrequirements:\n  host:\n    - python ${{ python_min }}.*\n    - pip\n    - setuptools\n    - setuptools-scm\n  run:\n    - python >=${{ python_min }}\n    - numpy >=1.18\n    - scipy >=0.18\n    - nibabel >=5.4\n    - h5py >=2.9\n    - dill\n    - backports.zstd\n  run_constraints:\n    - indexed_gzip >=0.7\n    - wxpython >=4\n    - trimesh >=2.37.29\n    - rtree >=0.8.3\n    - dcm2niix >=1.0.20171215\n    - pillow >=3.2.0\n\ntests:\n  - files:\n      source:\n        - pyproject.toml\n        - conftest.py\n        - fsl/tests\n    requirements:\n      run:\n        - mock\n        - coverage\n        - pytest\n        - pytest-cov\n        - trimesh >=2.37.29\n        - rtree >=0.8.3\n        - indexed_gzip >=0.7\n        - dcm2niix >=1.0.20171215\n        - pillow >=3.2.0\n        - python ${{ python_min }}.*\n    script:\n      - pytest -x -v --cov=fsl -m \"not (wxtest or unixtest or longtest or fsltest or noroottest or dicomtest or mrstest)\" -k \"not (fslsub or fslstats)\" fsl/tests\n\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://git.fmrib.ox.ac.uk/fsl/fslpy/\n  license: Apache-2.0\n  license_file: LICENSE\n  summary: The FSL Python library\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - pauldmccarthy\n",
